    dc:description "public cross-formalism catalog of simple-program behavior";
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://atlas.wolfram.com/>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch03-01--gpt--analysis-feasibility> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
